  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Idylls of the King**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Doc Gooden**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Minnesota**: back after 58 archived shows (528 days) [3]\n- **Stable Boy Song**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2024-12-13** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 103 min [1]. Said about its sound: Uploader tried to remove the whistling from the recording, but some lingering artifacts remain [1]\n- **mountaingoats2024-12-13.flac16**: source not stated; 22 songs; 103 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: between songs quiet and Water Tower, last night of tour goodbyes and thanks, new album tease, No Children [1]\n- Someone in the venue whistled repeatedly, including during songs, which was hard on people standing nearby [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2024-12-13**: taped by Kyle Kennelly & Emerald Green (Tape&Bake); transferred by Kyle Kennelly; source: SBD [Brandon Eggleston] > Tascam FR-AV2 + DPA 4060 > FR-AV2 (Healy on stage) [1]. Also: Taped at Tipitina's with help from venue staff and front-of-house engineer Tubbs during setup [1]\n- **mountaingoats2024-12-13.flac16**: taped by ezralite23; transferred by ezralite23; source: Sony PCM-A10 [2]",
